# betterado_resource_authorization (Resource)

Manages resource authorization for a specific build pipeline in Azure DevOps.
This resource authorizes (or deauthorizes) a specific protected resource for use
by a named pipeline.

~> **Deprecation note:** Microsoft recommends using `betterado_pipeline_authorization`
for new configurations. This resource remains supported for existing deployments.

