## Import

Resource authorizations are imported using `projectID/resourceID/resourceType/definitionID`:

```shell
terraform import betterado_resource_authorization.example 00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000001/endpoint/42
```
